  "description": "File/set intake for the Goldpath enterprise asset (L3 of the execution ladder): content-addressed same-database file store, CSV parsing behind a format seam, typed per-row validation with a value-free report, an audited approve/reject gate, and execution of approved batches as Goldpath.Jobs runs - chunked, checkpointed, resumable, with row failures isolated into the repair queue and claim-before-side-effect semantics (bulk RFC D1-D7).",
